        "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD &lt;3</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/f1d980d0b76e7dc63279d3e2ad33dfc5.avif?t=1779148190\" width=460 height=100 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/733fda07f0994c3daad09c9e82052c0a.poster.avif?t=1779148190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/733fda07f0994c3daad09c9e82052c0a.webm?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/733fda07f0994c3daad09c9e82052c0a.mp4?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You teleported to the Evil God's Realm to save your Home Planet after being blessed with immortality by your Creator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find equipment that contains magic powers. Defeat hordes of monsters. Survive rains of projectiles. Stand up against the Gods! Can you slay the Evil Forces and become the true GOD HUNTER?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SOLO OR CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/e2b5c5be17843363df0f24839b6061ac.poster.avif?t=1779148190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/e2b5c5be17843363df0f24839b6061ac.webm?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/e2b5c5be17843363df0f24839b6061ac.mp4?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Defeat all the enemies by yourself or in co-op, synchronize your builds and strategies, share loot, and make the Evil Gods regret their choices!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>2 GAMES IN 1</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/421dad44d49da8f23637ba79a1b75758.poster.avif?t=1779148190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/421dad44d49da8f23637ba79a1b75758.webm?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/421dad44d49da8f23637ba79a1b75758.mp4?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First portal leads you deeper and deeper into the planet, seeking out and ultimately defeating its God. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the other one, you fight across large open maps, holding out as long as you can to stop invading forces from reaching your world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DIFFICULTY LEVELS &amp; BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/bb26b77a61639f40f105a1e0fc1724a4.poster.avif?t=1779148190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/bb26b77a61639f40f105a1e0fc1724a4.webm?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/bb26b77a61639f40f105a1e0fc1724a4.mp4?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay Huge Bosses! Each obtained Boss Soul increases the difficulty and unlocks new enemies, challenges, weapons, and items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HOOK FINISHERS &amp; WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/ad2be5d759e9d8725e135c37276458ad.poster.avif?t=1779148190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/ad2be5d759e9d8725e135c37276458ad.webm?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/ad2be5d759e9d8725e135c37276458ad.mp4?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use your Chain Hook to move faster and perform Finishers on low health enemies and find powerful weapons through each run with their own unique skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for Destructible Elements on enemies to weaken them during the fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CHESTS &amp; ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/ae275ec31560bcf1eb7ed3598e4b69c9.poster.avif?t=1779148190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/ae275ec31560bcf1eb7ed3598e4b69c9.webm?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/ae275ec31560bcf1eb7ed3598e4b69c9.mp4?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find powerful magic chests, each containing different upgrades, perks, items, and weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UPGRADES &amp; COMPANIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/507e89b39234025e7c928d1e6648fb11.poster.avif?t=1779148190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/507e89b39234025e7c928d1e6648fb11.webm?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/507e89b39234025e7c928d1e6648fb11.mp4?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue small Companions who will help you along your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade yourself permanently with crystals collected during fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developers Note: We really hope you will have a BLAST 💗</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/733fda07f0994c3daad09c9e82052c0a.poster.avif?t=1779148190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/733fda07f0994c3daad09c9e82052c0a.webm?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/733fda07f0994c3daad09c9e82052c0a.mp4?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You teleported to the Evil God's Realm to save your Home Planet after being blessed with immortality by your Creator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find equipment that contains magic powers. Defeat hordes of monsters. Survive rains of projectiles. Stand up against the Gods! Can you slay the Evil Forces and become the true GOD HUNTER?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SOLO OR CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/e2b5c5be17843363df0f24839b6061ac.poster.avif?t=1779148190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/e2b5c5be17843363df0f24839b6061ac.webm?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/e2b5c5be17843363df0f24839b6061ac.mp4?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Defeat all the enemies by yourself or in co-op, synchronize your builds and strategies, share loot, and make the Evil Gods regret their choices!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: c