kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/507e89b39234025e7c928d1e6648fb11.poster.avif?t=1779148190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/507e89b39234025e7c928d1e6648fb11.webm?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338490/extras/507e89b39234025e7c928d1e6648fb11.mp4?t=1779148190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue small Companions who will help you along your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade yourself permanently with crystals collected during fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developers Note: We really hope you will have a BLAST 💗</p>",
